{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_12106360","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12106360","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1210635001:":{"text":"내 실험 재료를 놓아준 게... 너희인가?","source_cn":"是你们把我的实验材料放走了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x77AA284A864B3F1F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1210636001:0":{"text":"우리 아가가 그렇게 경계를 하더라니... 다 너희 때문이었구나...","source_cn":"难怪我的小宝贝警戒起来了，原来是你们搞的鬼……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B7DA1AD13047A3C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1210636002:0":{"text":"아가? 이 뱀이 아가라고요?!","source_cn":"宝贝？你叫这条蛇宝贝？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x78AE2842FA773BE7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1210636003:0":{"text":"무례하기 짝이 없는 설치류구나! 너희는 뼈의 아름다움에 대해 아무것도 몰라.","source_cn":"无礼的啮齿动物！你们对于骨感的美一无所知。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x23F6858B43F0F7BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1210636004:0":{"text":"조금 전 사람들을 실험 재료라고 하다니, 너무하네요!","source_cn":"你刚才说这些人都是你的实验材料，太过分了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70BE2C1968C3B4FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"",